    "summary": "Beaded bandolier with mirrors and hide fringe, sewn and mounted onto cotton backing.  Beadwork is white, blue, yellow, orange, and maroon.  at the top near the cotton strip that goes around the neck, a mirror is mounted on either side.  The beadwork is beaded on a loom and then those strips are sewn to the cotton backing. Hide fringe on the bottom edge of each side. Part of an ensemble of powwow regalia.",
